  "releaseNotes": "#### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Fixed `Span.TryCopyTo` always returning true and span-aliasing bugs: `TryCopyTo` now correctly returns false when the destination is too small and leaves the destination unmodified, instead of re-pointing the destination at a slice of the source\n- `OptimisticCopy` no longer re-points the destination span at source memory; when the destination is too small it is replaced with a newly allocated span holding the copied elements",
